Package: bshare
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: BShare maintainers <maintainers@bshare.invalid>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Recommends: linux-headers-generic | linux-headers-amd64
Description: Share files, screens and device cameras over a local network
 BShare discovers nearby devices on the same LAN or Wi-Fi network and transfers
 files directly between them. It also supports local screen sharing.
 .
 NetworkManager, wpa_supplicant, dnsmasq and polkit are declared because BShare
 can create a temporary Wi-Fi hotspot when no local network is available.
